OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fwith variable cloud cover, best of any
OL,7,Fclear spells to the north of Skye.
OL,8,FShowery rain, perhaps heavy, could
OL,9,Faffect Lochaber and the Uists at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FBright or sunny spells with
OL,12,Fvery isolated heavy, perhaps thundery,
OL,13,Fshowers developing. Best of the
OL,14,Fsunshine around the west coast and
OL,15,Fover Skye and Eilean Siar. Feeling
OL,16,Fwarm.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain or
OL,19,Fshowers at times along with some drier
OL,20,Fand brighter spells. Winds will be
OL,21,Fmostly light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
